<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth in major industrialised countries and German industry trends for the six months from July 1996 issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 299 firms conducted from December 2-17. Figures in brackets show the change from November's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>				Good	  Normal	  Bad</p>
<p> Germany		 0.6  (+0.6)   52.2 (+7.6)   47.2 (-8.2)</p>
<p> U.S.		   72.6 (+ 0.4)   27.1(-+0.0)    0.3 (-0.4)</p>
<p> Japan		   1.4  (+0.7)   25.3 (-1.0)   73.3(+ 0.3)</p>
<p> Britain		41.6  (+3.9)   55.6 (-2.4)    2.8 (-1.5)</p>
<p> France		  0.7  (+0.4)   47.0 (+6.9)   52.3 (-7.3)</p>
<p> Italy		   1.4  (+0.7)   64.9 (+7.2)   33.7 (-7.9)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			     Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Germany		70.6  (-6.0)   28.1 (+6.7)    1.3 (-0.7)</p>
<p> U.S.		   +8.2  (+0.9)   84.6 (+3.4)    7.2 (-4.3)</p>
<p> Japan		  61.6  (-1.9)   35.9 (+2.9)    2.5 (-1.0)</p>
<p> Britain		15.4  (-1.0)   77.9 (-1.4)    6.7 (+2.4)</p>
<p> France		 61.5  (-2.1)   35.7 (+2.2)    2.8 (-0.1)</p>
<p> Italy		  34.5  (-3.5)   61.9 (+5.7)    3.6 (-2.2)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> GERMANY		  Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Banks		   34.9 (+1.7)   57.0 (-3.3)    8.1 (+1.6)</p>
<p> Insurance	     25.7 (+4.6)   66.5 (-2.6)    7.8 (-2.0)</p>
<p> Automotives	   75.3 (-2.4)   21.8 (+1.7)    2.9 (+0.7)</p>
<p> Chemicals	     70.5 (-2.1)   26.3 (+1.9)    3.2 (+0.2)</p>
<p> Steel		   40.6 (-0.5)   52.5 (+2.9)    6.9 (-2.4)</p>
<p> Electronics	   38.3 (-8.3)   54.0 (+7.7)    7.7 (+0.6)</p>
<p> Engineering	   57.2 (-3.9)   32.2 (+2.9)   10.6 (+1.0)</p>
<p> Consumer goods	14.0 (-5.4)   59.1 (-6.5)   26.9(+11.9)</p>
<p> Trade		   12.9 (-7.0)   59.5 (-6.3)   27.6(+13.3)</p>
<p> Construction	   4.2 (+0.5)   37.9 (-5.7)   57.9 (+5.2)</p>
